"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[1652],{31652:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"samsung-rekord-pamyat-smartfony-ceny","locale":"en","title":"Samsung earns a record $80 billion quarter from memory scarcity as smartphones become more expensive","description":"Samsung recorded 107.4 trillion won in operating profit for quarter III of 2026. Why AI memory demand is making smartphones more expensive worldwide and in Russia.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"On October 8, 2026, Samsung Electronics estimated quarter III operating profit at 107.4 trillion won, about $80.2 billion. A year earlier it was 12.2 trillion won, an almost 9-fold increase. Revenue rose to more than 2 times its earlier level to roughly 195 trillion won. The previous record of 89.5 trillion won was set in quarter II of 2026. Analysts expected slightly more, about 108 trillion won."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"Memory drove Samsung\'s profit growth, especially memory for artificial-intelligence servers. It is produced in the same factories as ordinary phone and laptop memory but sells at much higher prices. Imagine a bakery paid 3 times as much for restaurant cakes as for shop bread. It uses the same ovens and produces less bread. A new factory takes several years to build. Profit forgone by making ordinary memory instead of server memory is called opportunity cost."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"Mobile memory prices in quarter II of 2026 were almost 3 times their level in quarter IV of 2025. Since the start of 2026, more than 40% of smartphone models worldwide have become more expensive, by an average of 15%. New 2026 models cost 25% more than last year\'s. Fewer phones are being produced and purchased: Counterpoint Research lowered its forecast in June, expecting 2026 smartphone shipments to fall by 13.9% to 1.08 billion units. Samsung\'s Galaxy phone division recorded its first operating loss in quarter II, 0.7 trillion won, because of expensive memory."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"Russia sold 15.2 million smartphones over 37 weeks of 2026, 11.7% fewer than a year earlier. The average transaction value rose by 7.6% to 25.8 thousand rubles, reflecting both prices and buyers\' choices. Budget models economize on memory: the Redmi 17, released in September from 18 thousand rubles, has 4 GB of RAM. Over September 29–October 5, Russian smartphone prices rose by 1.1% and televisions by 1%. These are imported goods; from October 1 to 6, the official dollar rate rose from 83.56 to 84.93 rubles, so weekly price growth may reflect more than memory costs alone."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"TrendForce expects quarter IV 2026 contract prices for conventional memory to rise another 10–15% from quarter III, and flash memory by 15–20%. Samsung memory-division executive vice president Kim Jae-jun expects scarcity throughout 2026 and much of 2027, possibly until 2028. SK hynix chief Kwak Noh-jung called 2027 potentially the worst year for memory supply in the industry\'s history."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"A phone now costs more than a year ago. A purchase can be delayed, but manufacturers themselves expect memory shortages to persist into 2027. A stronger ruble would soften price growth; a weaker one would amplify it."},{"id":"b007","kind":"heading","text":"Why are smartphones becoming more expensive in 2026?"},{"id":"b008","kind":"paragraph","text":"Because of memory shortages. Manufacturers are shifting factories toward expensive AI-server memory, leaving too little ordinary phone memory. Mobile memory in quarter II of 2026 cost almost 3 times as much as at the end of 2025, while global smartphones have risen by an average of 15% since the start of the year."},{"id":"b009","kind":"heading","text":"How much have smartphones become more expensive in Russia?"},{"id":"b010","kind":"paragraph","text":"Over 37 weeks of 2026, the average purchased smartphone price in Russia rose by 7.6% to 25.8 thousand rubles, while unit sales fell by 11.7%. Smartphone prices increased by 1.1% over September 29–October 5."},{"id":"b011","kind":"heading","text":"When will the memory shortage end?"},{"id":"b012","kind":"paragraph","text":"Manufacturers make no promise. Samsung expects shortages throughout 2026 and much of 2027, potentially until 2028. SK hynix\'s chief called 2027 potentially the worst memory-supply year in industry history."}],"sources":[{"label":"Samsung Estimates Record $80 Billion Operating Profit in Q3 2026","url":"https://sammyguru.com/samsung-estimates-record-80-billion-operating-profit-q3-2026/"},{"label":"Samsung forecasts record third-quarter profit of $80 billion as AI boom fuels chip demand","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/samsung-q3-earnings.html"},{"label":"Samsung\'s quarterly profit jumped ninefold to roughly $80 billion on AI chips","url":"https://startupfortune.com/samsungs-quarterly-profit-jumped-ninefold-to-roughly-80-billion-on-ai-chips/"},{"label":"The Samsung unit behind its Galaxy phones just reported its first quarterly loss ever","url":"https://www.phonearena.com/news/samsung-mobile-experience-unit-first-quarterly-loss_id182207"},{"label":"It will get worse: smartphone prices rise uncontrollably worldwide","url":"https://www.cnews.ru/news/top/2026-09-04_dalshe_budet_huzhev_mire"},{"label":"Memory Crunch Freezes Smartphone Market: 2026 Shipments Seen Plunging 13.9%","url":"https://finance.biggo.com/news/o46al54B6tLPsnrZsogu"},{"label":"AI Server Demand Sustains Memory Contract Price Increases in 4Q26","url":"https://www.trendforce.com/presscenter/news/20260930-13258.html"},{"label":"Russians buy fewer smartphones","url":"https://3dnews.ru/1149266"},{"label":"Russian inflation from September 29 to October 5","url":"https://www.vedomosti.ru/economics/news/2026/10/07/1235202-inflyatsiya-v-rossii"},{"label":"Samsung warns the RAM shortage will last through 2027, maybe 2028","url":"https://www.pcworld.com/article/3203764/samsung-warns-the-ram-shortage-will-last-through-2027-maybe-2028.html"},{"label":"SK Hynix Warns Memory Shortage Will Be Worst Ever in 2027","url":"https://propakistani.pk/2026/07/13/sk-hynix-warns-memory-shortage-will-be-worst-ever-in-2027/"}],"sourceBodySha256":"9109ae1c3a0a697fc17c90fd75c97bd35553c9ab1d7901b4a84036a4db6a8302"}')}}]);